title: '[sp-arithmetic] Fix PerThing Display approximate percent for non-power-of-ten
  types'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary

    Fixes incorrect percentage in `Display` for `PerThing` types where `$max` is not a power of ten: the code divided `self.0` by itself instead of by `$max`, so the approximate percent was always 100%.

    ## Change

    - Use `($max as f64)` as the denominator when computing the approximate percentage for debug/display output.

    ## Testing

    `SKIP_WASM_BUILD=1 cargo check -p sp-arithmetic --all-features`
crates:
- name: sp-arithmetic
  bump: patch
